          derivable_doc(id: "6-roundtrip-law", prs: [5525, 5527], title: "**round-trip law (ingest∘emit = id, DecodeFidelity-bounded)**", description: "— established across two structurally-different media: markdown (block-document) and GHA-expr (recursive-expression). v2-TargetModel convergence is the deferred single-authority destination; per-medium round-trips are v1-seed interim. Authority for the law: the round-trip oracle #5513 §5.2", path: "docs/plans/emission-ingestion-inverse.md"),
